      "question": "The expression \\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{3}{4}+\\left\\{2 \\frac{1}{2}-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\overline{\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{1}{7}}\\right)\\right\\}\\right]}{6}\\) equals:",
      "questionHtml": "The expression&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{3}{4}+\\left\\{2 \\frac{1}{2}-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\overline{\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{1}{7}}\\right)\\right\\}\\right]}{6}\\)</span> equals:",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{13}{56}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{13}{56}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{97}{168}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{97}{168}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{191}{504}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{191}{504}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{19}{54}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{19}{54}\\)</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{3}{4}+\\left\\{2 \\frac{1}{2}-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\overline{\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{1}{7}}\\right)\\right\\}\\right]}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Concept used:</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/07/Bodmas%20dtp.png\" style=\"width: 440px; height: 247px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{3}{4}+\\left\\{2 \\frac{1}{2}-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\overline{\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{1}{7}}\\right)\\right\\}\\right]}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{3}{4}+\\left\\{2 \\frac{1}{2}-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\left( {\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{1}{7}}\\right)\\right\\}\\right]\\right)}{6}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{3}{4}+\\left\\{2 \\frac{1}{2}-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+{\\frac{7-6}{42}}\\right)\\right\\}\\right]}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{3}{4}+\\left\\{2 \\frac{1}{2}-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+{\\frac{1}{42}}\\right)\\right\\}\\right]}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{3}{4}+\\left\\{2 \\frac{1}{2}-\\left({\\frac{21 + 1}{42}}\\right)\\right\\}\\right]}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{3}{4}+\\left\\{2 \\frac{1}{2}-\\left({\\frac{22}{42}}\\right)\\right\\}\\right]}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{3}{4}+\\left\\{\\frac{5}{2}-\\left({\\frac{22}{42}}\\right)\\right\\}\\right]}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{3}{4}+\\left\\{\\frac{105-22}{42}\\right\\}\\right]}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{3}{4}+\\left\\{\\frac{83}{42}\\right\\}\\right]}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{63+166}{84}\\right]}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5-\\left[\\frac{229}{84}\\right]}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\frac{420 - 229}{84}}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\frac{191}{84}}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{191}{504}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">&there4; The required answer is&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{191}{504}\\)</span>.</span></strong></p>\n",
