      "question": "Solve: \\(\\frac{(-2-3) \\times(5+3) \\div(-2-3)}{(-6-4) \\div(-7-5)}\\)",
      "questionHtml": "Solve:&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(-2-3) \\times(5+3) \\div(-2-3)}{(-6-4) \\div(-7-5)}\\)</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "96",
          "html": "96"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "6.9",
          "html": "6.9"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "-9.6",
          "html": "-9.6"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "9.6",
          "html": "9.6"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(-2-3) ×(5+3) ÷(-2-3)}{(-6-4) ÷(-7-5)}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula Used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Follow the order of operations (PEMDAS/BODMAS)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Calculate the values step by step:</p>\n\n<p>(-2 - 3) = -5</p>\n\n<p>(5 + 3) = 8</p>\n\n<p>(-2 - 3) = -5</p>\n\n<p>(-6 - 4) = -10</p>\n\n<p>(-7 - 5) = -12</p>\n\n<p>Now substitute back into the expression:</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\left(-5 × 8 ÷ -5\\right) ÷ \\left(-10 ÷ -12\\right)\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>Simplify inside the parentheses first:</p>\n\n<p>-5 &times;&nbsp;8 = -40</p>\n\n<p>-40 &divide;&nbsp;-5 = 8</p>\n\n<p>Simplify the second part:</p>\n\n<p>-10 &divide; -12 = <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{10}{12} = \\frac{5}{6}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>Now divide the results:</p>\n\n<p>8 &divide; <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5}{6}\\)</span>&nbsp;= 8 &times; (6/5)</p>\n\n<p>48/5 = 9.6</p>\n\n<p><strong>The correct answer is option 4, 9.6.</strong></p>\n",
