      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{13}{2}\\left[ {15 \\div \\;\\frac{3}{5}\\;of\\;\\frac{1}{2} + 76 + 1\\;\\frac{1}{2} \\times 4\\frac{1}{2}\\; \\div 3\\frac{1}{4}} \\right]\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Concept used:</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/04/Bodmas%20dtp.png\" style=\" width: 400px; height: 225px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{13}{2}\\left[ {15 \\div \\;\\frac{3}{5}\\;of\\;\\frac{1}{2} + 76 + 1\\;\\frac{1}{2} \\times 4\\frac{1}{2}\\; \\div 3\\frac{1}{4}} \\right]\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{13}{2}\\)</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\left[ {15 \\div \\;\\frac{3}{10} + 76 + 1\\;\\frac{1}{2} \\times 4\\frac{1}{2}\\; \\div 3\\frac{1}{4}} \\right]\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{13}{2}\\)</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\left[ {15 \\times \\;\\frac{10}{3} + 76 + \\;\\frac{3}{2} \\times \\frac{9}{2}\\; \\times\\frac{4}{13}} \\right]\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{13}{2}\\)</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\left[ {50 + 76 + \\;\\frac{27}{13}} \\right]\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{13}{2}\\)</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\left[ {\\frac{650\\ +\\ 988\\ +\\ 27}{13}} \\right]\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;</span>&nbsp;832.5</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; Required answer is 832.5</strong></p>\n",
