      "id": "b9920076c960-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "Let a = \\(11\\over100\\) , and b = \\(1.\\overline{01}\\) , then a &minus; b is:",
      "questionHtml": "Let a =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(11\\over100\\)</span>, and b =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(1.\\overline{01}\\)</span>, then a&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);   \">&minus; b is:</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "&minus; \\(8911\\over9090\\)",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);   \">&minus;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(8911\\over9090\\)</span></span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(8911\\over9900\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(8911\\over9900\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(8911\\over9090\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(8911\\over9090\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "&minus; \\(8911\\over9900\\)",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);   \">&minus;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(8911\\over9900\\)</span></span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Given:</span></p>\n\n<p>a=<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(11\\over100\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>b=<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(1.\\overline{01}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Concept:</span></p>\n\n<p>The decimal 1.01010101 can be written as&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(1.\\overline01\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Here, 01&nbsp;consists of two&nbsp;terms, and it is repeated in a continuous manner. Thus, the number of time 9 to be repeated in the denominator becomes two</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(1.\\overline01 = \\frac{101 - 1}{99}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{100}{99}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);   \">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>a =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{11}{100}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&rArr; b =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{100}{99}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&rArr;&nbsp;a-b =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{11}{100}-\\frac{100}{99}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1089-10000}{9900}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(-\\frac{8911}{9900} \\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&there4; <b>the Correct Answer is&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(-\\frac{8911}{9900} \\)</span></b></p>\n\n<div class=\"mathjax-scroll\" style=\"overflow: auto hidden;\">\n<div class=\"mathjax-scroll\" style=\"overflow: auto hidden;\"><span class=\"latex-for-amp\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"7\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"line-height: 0;  position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" style=\"display: inline-block; line-height: 0; border-collapse: collapse; overflow-wrap: normal; word-spacing: normal; direction: ltr; padding: 1px 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"display: inline-block; text-align: center; vertical-align: 0.25em; position: relative; border-spacing: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 5.112em;\"><mjx-table style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: -0.5ex;\"><mjx-itable style=\"display: inline-table; vertical-align: middle; text-align: left;\"><mjx-mtr style=\"display: table-row;\"><mjx-mtd style=\"display: table-cell; padding: 0px;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math></mjx-container></span>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n",
